For each lesson, confirm that:
- the QA record covers the current lesson code (Demo.tsx unchanged since the QA run; check with git log);
- the latest learner review is launch for the current version;
- every claim is verified.

Remove the hold only for those that pass, then publish them with `node tools/publish-ready.mjs --publish`. Keep the hold, with an updated reason, for any that don't. If your permissions block the edit, stop and say so. Append a "Wave A2 holds resolved" section to company/rituals/records/2026-10-14-launch-review-wave-C.md. Run `npm run check`. Report in under 80 words: the published count before and after, and any holds kept.

